IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. RENAMEX.
AUTHOR. JU

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 WS-EMPLOYEE.
   05 WS-EMP-ID     PIC 9(5).
   05 WS-EMP-NAME   PIC X(20).
   05 WS-EMP-SALARY PIC 9(6).
   05 WS-EMP-DEPT   PIC X(10).

66 WS-EMP-DETAILS RENAMES
   WS-EMP-NAME THRU WS-EMP-SALARY.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    MOVE 12345 TO WS-EMP-ID.
    MOVE "VIJAY" TO WS-EMP-NAME.
    MOVE 50000 TO WS-EMP-SALARY.
    MOVE "IT" TO WS-EMP-DEPT.

    DISPLAY WS-EMP-DETAILS.
    STOP RUN.
